{"ref":"BDB, אֶלְיָקִים","hw":"אֶלְיָקִים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְיָקִים</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>God sets up</em>, cf. Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">הקמאל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יקמאל</span> Hal<sup>615</sup><strong>) </strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  Hezekiah’s prefect of the palace <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.18\">2 K 18:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:37\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.2\">19:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.20\">Is 22:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.3\">36:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.2\">37:2</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  son of Josiah, made king by Pharaoh <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:34\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.34\">2 K 23:34</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.4\">2 Ch 36:4</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹיָקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.1\">2 K 24:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.3\">Je 1:3</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.15\">1 Ch 3:15</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  a priest <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:41\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.41\">Ne 12:41</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱלִישֶׁ֫בַע","prev":"BDB, אֱלִיקָא"}